WEBVTT

00:14:28.162 --> 00:14:30.996
We'll be right back with more from
Franklin Leonard after this break.

00:14:37.496 --> 00:14:38.579
Here we are, we're back.

00:14:39.454 --> 00:14:43.287
How do you think people who
maybe don't see themselves

00:14:43.287 --> 00:14:45.246
as having that kind of power,

00:14:45.412 --> 00:14:48.954
how can they think about the

00:14:49.204 --> 00:14:51.996
the creative force that they
can they can create change?

00:14:51.996 --> 00:14:55.371
And I think it's really about just
modeling your values in your day to day

00:14:55.371 --> 00:15:00.162
actions. You don't have to be an
advocate to to change the way